## Agent Guidelines & Boundaries
1. **Never guess API schemas or variable names**: Inspect source files before consuming symbols.
2. **Verification First**: Always run tests or build commands to verify changes before marking tasks complete.
3. **Log Failure Patterns**: Record recurring bugs, framework quirks, or edge cases in `.ai/LESSONS_LEARNED.md`.
4. **Track Feature Progress**: Record development session summaries under relevant features in `.ai/FEATURE_HISTORY.md`.
5. **Maintain Task Backlog**: Update task checkboxes (`[ ]`, `[/]`, `[x]`) in `.ai/TASKS.md`.

## Always-Enabled Workflow Rules
- Follow Test-Driven Development (TDD) where applicable.
- Keep commits granular and documented.
- Preserve existing API contracts and docstrings unless explicitly instructed otherwise.
